content:
**Source:** Extracted from Veo genesis commercia.txt + Research (Google VEO 3 JSON capabilities 2025)

**JSON-First Breakthrough (July 2025):**

Google VEO 3 responds with superior precision when prompts are structured as JSON objects rather than natural language paragraphs. This approach provides:
- Nested object control for complex specifications
- Character continuity tracking across series
- Professional cinematography precision
- Audio engineering accuracy
- Meta-control systems with priority stacks

**Master JSON Template:**

```json
{
  "version": "veo_3_professional_2025",
  "output": {
    "resolution": "1080p",
    "aspect_ratio": "16:9",
    "duration": "8s",
    "frame_rate": "24fps",
    "generation_mode": "veo_3_standard"
  },
  "global_style": {
    "visual_aesthetic": "cinematic corporate",
    "color_palette": "warm professional tones with natural skin rendering",
    "film_grade": "digital clean with professional color correction",
    "mood": "confident, trustworthy, engaging, forward-moving"
  },
  "character": {
    "name": "Elena Rodriguez",
    "consistency_id": "elena_series_001",
    "physical": {
      "age": "early 30s",
      "ethnicity": "Latina",
      "gender": "female",
      "build": "medium athletic build, 5'6\" height reference",
      "hair": "dark brown shoulder-length with subtle waves, professional styling",
      "eyes": "warm brown eyes with confident expression",
      "facial_features": "warm smile, high cheekbones, expressive eyebrows",
      "distinctive_marks": "small beauty mark above right eyebrow"
    },
    "wardrobe": {
      "primary": "navy blue tailored blazer, structured fit",
      "secondary": "white silk blouse, modest neckline",
      "accessories": "minimal gold jewelry - small hoop earrings, thin bracelet",
      "overall_style": "professional corporate executive"
    },
    "reference_images": ["character_ref_001.jpg", "character_ref_002.jpg"]
  },
  "shot_composition": {
    "subject": {
      "description": "Professional woman in early 30s, Latina, medium athletic build, shoulder-length dark brown hair with subtle waves, warm brown eyes with confident expression, small beauty mark above right eyebrow, wearing navy blue tailored blazer over white silk blouse, minimal gold jewelry, positioned center-left of frame using rule of thirds",
      "framing": "medium shot transitioning to medium close-up",
      "positioning": "center-left third, eye-line at upper third horizontal",
      "emotional_state": "confident, approachable, engaging"
    },
    "action": {
      "primary": "transitions from thoughtful listening pose to active speaking with animated gestures",
      "timing": "first 2 seconds listening with slight head tilt, seconds 3-8 speaking with natural hand gestures",
      "facial_progression": "attentive expression transitions to confident enthusiasm",
      "gestures": "subtle hand movements emphasizing key words, natural blink patterns, authentic micro-expressions"
    },
    "scene": {
      "location": "contemporary open-plan office, floor-to-ceiling windows with natural daylight",
      "lighting": {
        "primary": "natural daylight from large windows camera left, soft even illumination",
        "fill": "office ambient lighting, modern LED fixtures creating balanced exposure",
        "practical": "computer monitors softly glowing in background",
        "quality": "soft professional lighting, no harsh shadows"
      },
      "background": {
        "near": "modern white desk with computer monitor in soft focus",
        "mid": "office workspace with indoor plants, professional environment",
        "far": "windows showing neutral outdoor light, depth created by multiple layers"
      },
      "atmosphere": "professional but welcoming, modern corporate environment"
    },
    "cinematography": {
      "shot_type": "medium shot (MS) transitioning to medium close-up (MCU)",
      "aspect_ratio": "16:9",
      "angle": "eye level to slight low angle, creates confident presence",
      "camera_movement": {
        "type": "slow dolly in",
        "speed": "subtle push over 8 seconds",
        "start_position": "medium shot showing upper body and desk",
        "end_position": "medium close-up emphasizing facial expressions",
        "positioning": "camera at subject's chest height, 5 feet distance (thats where the camera is)",
        "stabilization": "gimbal smooth professional movement"
      },
      "lens_characteristics": {
        "focal_length_feel": "50mm equivalent natural perspective",
        "depth_of_field": "moderate - subject sharp, background softly blurred",
        "focus": "tracks on subject's eyes throughout movement"
      },
      "visual_style": {
        "aesthetic": "cinematic corporate",
        "color_grade": "warm professional tones, accurate skin tones, slight lift in shadows",
        "contrast": "moderate contrast maintaining detail",
        "saturation": "natural with slight enhancement for professional polish"
      }
    },
    "dialogue": {
      "speaker": "Elena Rodriguez",
      "line": "Our Q3 results exceeded expectations, positioning us for unprecedented growth opportunities.",
      "tone": "confident, authoritative, measured delivery with slight warmth",
      "delivery": "clear enunciation, natural pacing, emphasizes 'exceeded' and 'growth'",
      "word_count": 12,
      "syllable_count": 24,
      "timing": "dialogue begins at second 2, completes by second 7.5",
      "lip_sync_priority": true
    },
    "audio": {
      "dialogue": {
        "quality": "crystal clear professional recording",
        "volume": "foreground at 100%",
        "processing": "clean with natural room tone"
      },
      "ambient": {
        "environment": "modern office atmosphere",
        "elements": [
          "distant keyboard typing at 15% volume",
          "subtle HVAC air circulation at 10% volume",
          "soft paper rustling at 8% volume"
        ],
        "acoustics": "professional office space with moderate room tone"
      },
      "music": {
        "present": true,
        "genre": "inspirational corporate underscore",
        "mood": "motivational, forward-moving, optimistic",
        "instrumentation": "piano, strings, subtle electronic elements",
        "volume": {
          "during_dialogue": "25% - supportive background",
          "instrumental_moments": "70% - more prominent during first 2 seconds"
        }
      },
      "specific_sounds": [
        "confident footsteps on hard flooring (subtle, background)",
        "chair slight movement during gesture (minimal, natural)"
      ],
      "hallucination_prevention": {
        "exclude": [
          "audience laughter or reactions",
          "phone ringing",
          "loud background conversations",
          "jarring or distracting noises",
          "music that competes with dialogue"
        ]
      }
    },
    "technical_negative": {
      "visual": [
        "subtitles", "captions", "text overlays", "watermarks",
        "blurry footage", "focus issues", "motion blur",
        "harsh lighting", "dark shadows on face", "overexposed windows",
        "unprofessional background elements", "messy environment",
        "distracting motion in background"
      ],
      "audio": [
        "audio sync issues", "echo or reverb", "distorted speech",
        "competing audio elements", "sudden volume changes"
      ],
      "composition": [
        "awkward framing", "subject too small in frame", "tilted horizon",
        "poor rule of thirds adherence", "cluttered composition"
      ],
      "performance": [
        "frozen mid-blink expressions", "unnatural movements",
        "robotic gestures", "lack of micro-expressions"
      ]
    }
  },
  "meta_control": {
    "priority_stack": [
      "Character physical consistency (Elena Rodriguez)",
      "Dialogue lip-sync accuracy and timing",
      "Professional lighting maintaining face visibility",
      "Smooth camera movement without jarring",
      "Audio clarity with dialogue prominence"
    ],
    "quality_gates": [
      "Verify character matches reference images",
      "Confirm dialogue timing within 8-second duration",
      "Check audio mix with dialogue foreground",
      "Validate professional corporate aesthetic maintained"
    ]
  }
}
```

**JSON Workflow:**
1. Copy master template
2. Customize character, scene, and dialogue details
3. Adjust cinematography and audio specifications
4. Set priority stack for quality control
5. Generate with VEO 3 API or paste into interface
6. Iterate using JSON modifications for precise adjustments

---

**Source:** Extracted from Veo genesis commercia.txt

**Use Case:** Show product in real-world use, demonstrate scale, create emotional connection

**Example - Headphones in Coffee Shop:**

```json
{
  "output": {"resolution": "1080p", "aspect_ratio": "16:9", "duration": "8s"},
  "subject": "Professional woman in late 20s wearing premium black wireless headphones while working on laptop in modern café, casual professional attire, focused productive expression",
  "product_placement": "headphones worn on subject, clearly visible with brand logo facing camera, product is hero element with sharpest focus",
  "action": {
    "primary": "woman typing on laptop with focused concentration",
    "secondary": "slight head movement as she reviews screen, natural gestures adjusting headphones comfort",
    "timing": "continuous natural working motion over 8 seconds"
  },
  "scene": {
    "location": "modern café interior with large windows",
    "background": "wooden table in foreground, laptop and white coffee cup visible, café interior softly blurred with warm window light from left, hanging plants barely visible in background",
    "atmosphere": "warm, inviting, productive workspace, aspirational lifestyle"
  },
  "cinematography": {
    "shot_type": "medium shot showing upper body, laptop, and coffee cup",
    "camera": "3/4 view from slightly above table height, 50mm-85mm lens feel, shallow depth of field (f/2.8-f/4)",
    "focus": "sharp on headphones and subject's hands on keyboard, soft blur on café background, smooth circular bokeh",
    "camera_position": "5 feet from subject at table height (thats where the camera is)",
    "movement": "subtle natural handheld feel or locked-off static, professional stability"
  },
  "lighting": {
    "primary": "soft natural window light from camera-left",
    "fill": "ambient café lighting, warm color temperature 3500K-4500K",
    "quality": "soft, flattering, realistic café ambiance"
  },
  "audio": {
    "ambient": ["modern café atmosphere at 20% volume", "distant espresso machine at 10%", "soft background conversations at 12% (muffled)", "gentle cup placement sounds at 8%"],
    "music": {"genre": "minimal modern acoustic", "mood": "focused, productive, contemporary", "volume": "50% throughout"},
    "specific_sounds": ["subtle keyboard typing at 18% volume", "very quiet headphone adjustment sound"],
    "exclude": ["loud conversations", "jarring café sounds", "phone rings"]
  }
}
```

---

**The Dialogue Priority Rule:**
Dialogue should ALWAYS be the clearest foreground element when present. Music and ambient sounds support but never compete.

**Volume Hierarchy:**
1. **Dialogue:** 100% foreground clarity
2. **Specific/Diegetic Sounds:** 15-30% (sounds from within the scene - footsteps, object sounds)
3. **Music:** 15-35% during dialogue, 40-80% during instrumental moments
4. **Ambient:** 5-15% (environmental texture, always subtle)

**Ducking Technique:**
"Music ducks to [X%] volume when dialogue present, rises to [Y%] volume during instrumental moments"

**Example Complete Audio Specification:**
```json
{
  "audio": {
    "dialogue": {
      "priority": "foreground",
      "quality": "crystal clear professional",
      "volume": "100% - absolute clarity and prominence"
    },
    "music": {
      "genre": "inspirational corporate",
      "mood": "motivational, professional",
      "volume": {
        "during_dialogue": "25% - ducks below dialogue, supportive background",
        "instrumental_sections": "65% - rises during visual-only moments, seconds 0-2 and 8"
      },
      "ducking": "music automatically ducks when dialogue present, rises during visual-only sections"
    },
    "ambient": {
      "environment": "modern office",
      "elements": ["keyboard typing at 12%", "HVAC at 8%", "paper rustle at 6%"],
      "total_ambient_volume": "10-15% range - subtle environmental texture"
    },
    "specific_sounds": [
      "footsteps at 18% when walking",
      "door close at 20% when entering",
      "chair movement at 12% when sitting"
    ],
    "mixing_priority": "Dialogue > Specific Sounds > Music > Ambient"
  }
}
```

---
